# The context is a finished tree, not a source checkout: node_modules, apps/daemon/dist and
# apps/web/dist are produced on the runner and copied in verbatim. The migrations are the one
# thing that ships as source — drizzle reads the .sql files at boot — so they are named here too.
# Nothing else is read.
*
!node_modules
!apps/daemon/dist
!apps/daemon/migrations
!apps/web/dist
